Description:
Các ý cần làm:
- Type Snapshot: Screen, Control (key, role, tag, type, order, text{label,placeholder}, options, style, attrs)
- Enum ChangeType: TEXT_CHANGED, OPTIONS_CHANGED, CONTROL_ADDED, CONTROL_REMOVED, LOCATOR_BROKEN, CONTROL_REORDERED, TYPE_CHANGED, STYLE_CHANGED, MISSING_TRANSLATION, UNTRANSLATED, STRUCTURAL_DRIFT
- Type Registry: control{key, locator{strategy,value,options}, track[]}
- Type Diff/Report: Change{changeType, key, before, after, severity}, RunReport{runId, project, locale, changes[]}
- Tên field/ChangeType khớp _shared/naming.md; lệch quy ước thì DỪNG và hỏi
